{
    "title": "Peachy - AI Face & Body Editor",
    "description": "Aiming for perfection in every detail, <b>Peachy</b> stands out as a powerful and user-friendly professional photo editor, especially for <b>photo retouch, face tuning and body reshape.</b> Enhance your Natural Beauty with our amazing face app! <b>No Watermark and Free.</b>\r\n\r\nEverybody is an excellent photographer with this simple photo retouch app, Peachy helps you meet the best version of you, smooth skin, whiten teeth, reshape body, fix blemishes, remove wrinkles, face tuning, get taller and slim, get perfect curves, etc.\r\n\r\nPeachy provides lots of portrait and <b>selfie</b> photo editing features:\r\n\r\n<b>Photo Retouch</b>\r\n- Smooth and retouch your skin\r\n- Remove wrinkles and acne\r\n- Brighten your eyes naturally\r\n- Perfect your smile with Teeth Whitener\r\n- Add volume and darken your eyebrows\r\n- Get rid of oily skin with the Matte retouch tool\r\n\r\n<b>Face Tune & Body Reshape</b>\r\n- Fine tune face shape, width, and other facial features\r\n- Reshape your body and facial structure\r\n- Refine a specific area of the selfie, for example, arms or facial features\r\n- Bloat your breast to get big boobs, enlarge muscles and get shapely figure\r\n- Creatively use the Reshape tool to enhance and exaggerate features\r\n\r\n<b>Face Editor</b>\r\n- Plump your lips in a snap with our face app\r\n- Auto reshape nose, eyes, eyebrows in every details, the best face app with Free features\r\n- Multi-face supported face app: Edit group photos easily with support for <b>up to 20 faces</b>\r\n- Independently adjust the shape of the left or right side of the face, along with the eyes and eyebrows\r\n\r\n<b>Body Editor</b>\r\n- Get small waist and big buttocks easily\r\n- Slim your legs, or elongate your legs to get taller\r\n- Enhance your body both laterally and longitudinally\r\n- Enhance or slim your arms as you want\r\n\r\n<b>AI Touch</b>\r\n- <b>Automatically retouch your face</b>: remove wrinkles, acne, dark circles, smooth skin, and whiten teeth\r\n- Easily edit group photos with multi-face support: up to 20 faces\r\n\r\n<b>Hair Color Changer</b>\r\n- Dye your hair with hair color changer\r\n- Hair makeover with ombr\u00e9 hair, various color to choose from\r\n\r\n<b>Basic Photo Editing Tools</b>\r\nMore than just a face editor and body editor, Peachy provides basic photo editor features:\r\n\u2726 <b>Crop</b> - Freely rotate and crop your photos to adapt for social media ratios and any other situations.\r\n\u2726 <b>Adjust</b> - Easily adjust brightness, contrast, warmth, shadows, sharpness, vignette, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>Filters for Selfies</b>\r\n- High-fashion vintage photo filters app\r\n- Perfect filters for selfies\r\n\r\n<b>Trendy Effects</b>\r\n- Improve lighting effects of the selfie or portrait\r\n- Explore a variety of trending photo effects located in the sticker menu\r\n\r\nWith all the powerful and distinctive face and body editor features above, Peachy helps you perfect your selfies or portraits like a pro! Share your artwork to Instagram, Snapchat, WhatsApp, Facebook, etc. <b>No Watermark.</b> It can be fun and inspiring!\r\n\r\nAny suggestions or feedback for Peachy \u2013 AI Face & Body Editor, please email us at peachy.android@inshot.com. We will get back to you as soon as possible.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Aiming for perfection in every detail, <b>Peachy</b> stands out as a powerful and user-friendly professional photo editor, especially for <b>photo retouch, face tuning and body reshape.</b> Enhance your Natural Beauty with our amazing face app! <b>No Watermark and Free.</b><br><br>Everybody is an excellent photographer with this simple photo retouch app, Peachy helps you meet the best version of you, smooth skin, whiten teeth, reshape body, fix blemishes, remove wrinkles, face tuning, get taller and slim, get perfect curves, etc.<br><br>Peachy provides lots of portrait and <b>selfie</b> photo editing features:<br><br><b>Photo Retouch</b><br>- Smooth and retouch your skin<br>- Remove wrinkles and acne<br>- Brighten your eyes naturally<br>- Perfect your smile with Teeth Whitener<br>- Add volume and darken your eyebrows<br>- Get rid of oily skin with the Matte retouch tool<br><br><b>Face Tune &amp; Body Reshape</b><br>- Fine tune face shape, width, and other facial features<br>- Reshape your body and facial structure<br>- Refine a specific area of the selfie, for example, arms or facial features<br>- Bloat your breast to get big boobs, enlarge muscles and get shapely figure<br>- Creatively use the Reshape tool to enhance and exaggerate features<br><br><b>Face Editor</b><br>- Plump your lips in a snap with our face app<br>- Auto reshape nose, eyes, eyebrows in every details, the best face app with Free features<br>- Multi-face supported face app: Edit group photos easily with support for <b>up to 20 faces</b><br>- Independently adjust the shape of the left or right side of the face, along with the eyes and eyebrows<br><br><b>Body Editor</b><br>- Get small waist and big buttocks easily<br>- Slim your legs, or elongate your legs to get taller<br>- Enhance your body both laterally and longitudinally<br>- Enhance or slim your arms as you want<br><br><b>AI Touch</b><br>- <b>Automatically retouch your face</b>: remove wrinkles, acne, dark circles, smooth skin, and whiten teeth<br>- Easily edit group photos with multi-face support: up to 20 faces<br><br><b>Hair Color Changer</b><br>- Dye your hair with hair color changer<br>- Hair makeover with ombr\u00e9 hair, various color to choose from<br><br><b>Basic Photo Editing Tools</b><br>More than just a face editor and body editor, Peachy provides basic photo editor features:<br>\u2726 <b>Crop</b> - Freely rotate and crop your photos to adapt for social media ratios and any other situations.<br>\u2726 <b>Adjust</b> - Easily adjust brightness, contrast, warmth, shadows, sharpness, vignette, etc.<br><br><b>Filters for Selfies</b><br>- High-fashion vintage photo filters app<br>- Perfect filters for selfies<br><br><b>Trendy Effects</b><br>- Improve lighting effects of the selfie or portrait<br>- Explore a variety of trending photo effects located in the sticker menu<br><br>With all the powerful and distinctive face and body editor features above, Peachy helps you perfect your selfies or portraits like a pro! Share your artwork to Instagram, Snapchat, WhatsApp, Facebook, etc. <b>No Watermark.</b> It can be fun and inspiring!<br><br>Any suggestions or feedback for Peachy \u2013 AI Face &amp; Body Editor, please email us at peachy.android@inshot.com. We will get back to you as soon as possible.",
